{
    "title": "Notes Launcher: Notepad, To-do",
    "description": "Jot down thoughts, ideas and important information with Notes Launcher. Swipe right from your home screen to create quick notes or to-do lists, share them with friends and family, add locks to secure sensitive information, and more. \r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 One-swipe access\r\n\u2713 Note-taking\r\n\u2713 Text formatting tools\r\n\u2713 Color-code notes\r\n\u2713 Lock notes\r\n\u2713 Categorize\r\n\u2713 Sort \r\n\u2713 Find\r\n\u2713 Share \r\n\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: Get quick access to Notes Launcher's features with one swipe from your home screen. No more digging through your app list; the notes app is just a swipe away.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddCreate notes & checklists: Quickly jot down ideas and important information on the go. Make a grocery list, a wish list, or a to-do list, then check off items as you accomplish them. \r\n\r\n\u2728Text formatting tools: Enhance your notes with the rich-text editor. Change font sizes, italicize or underline text, and create bulleted or numbered lists.  \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Color-code notes: Choose a note color to easily categorize and prioritize information. Whether it\u2019s managing work tasks or weekend plans, color-coding makes organizing your notes easier. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd10 Lock notes: Secure sensitive information like passwords, bank account details, medical prescriptions and more in a locked note. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Categorize: Save notes under custom categories like vacation checklists or emergency contacts. Group related notes together to instantly access them at any time. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea6 Sort: Use the sorting filter to arrange notes by the date they were modified or in  ascending/descending order of creation to easily find what you need.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Find: Quickly find what you\u2019re looking for with Notes Launcher\u2019s intuitive search feature. Enter a keyword or phrase in the app\u2019s search bar to quickly locate relevant notes. \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Share: Planning a travel itinerary? Working on a group project? Share your notes with family and friends through email, social media and other messaging apps.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the Notes Launcher shortcut on your home screen to jot down quick notes, create to-do lists, and easily access important information. \r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Notes Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nExplore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://notepadhome.app/#faq \r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://notepadhome.app/contact-us\r\n\r\nTerms of Service - https://notepadhome.app/terms-of-service    \r\nPrivacy Policy - https://notepadhome.app/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jot down thoughts, ideas and important information with Notes Launcher. Swipe right from your home screen to create quick notes or to-do lists, share them with friends and family, add locks to secure sensitive information, and more. <br><br>Key features:<br>\u2713 One-swipe access<br>\u2713 Note-taking<br>\u2713 Text formatting tools<br>\u2713 Color-code notes<br>\u2713 Lock notes<br>\u2713 Categorize<br>\u2713 Sort <br>\u2713 Find<br>\u2713 Share <br>\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: Get quick access to Notes Launcher&#39;s features with one swipe from your home screen. No more digging through your app list; the notes app is just a swipe away.<br><br>\ud83d\udcddCreate notes &amp; checklists: Quickly jot down ideas and important information on the go. Make a grocery list, a wish list, or a to-do list, then check off items as you accomplish them. <br><br>\u2728Text formatting tools: Enhance your notes with the rich-text editor. Change font sizes, italicize or underline text, and create bulleted or numbered lists.  <br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Color-code notes: Choose a note color to easily categorize and prioritize information. Whether it\u2019s managing work tasks or weekend plans, color-coding makes organizing your notes easier. <br><br>\ud83d\udd10 Lock notes: Secure sensitive information like passwords, bank account details, medical prescriptions and more in a locked note. <br><br>\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Categorize: Save notes under custom categories like vacation checklists or emergency contacts. Group related notes together to instantly access them at any time. <br><br>\ud83d\udea6 Sort: Use the sorting filter to arrange notes by the date they were modified or in  ascending/descending order of creation to easily find what you need.<br><br>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Find: Quickly find what you\u2019re looking for with Notes Launcher\u2019s intuitive search feature. Enter a keyword or phrase in the app\u2019s search bar to quickly locate relevant notes. <br><br>\ud83e\udd1d Share: Planning a travel itinerary? Working on a group project? Share your notes with family and friends through email, social media and other messaging apps.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.<br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the Notes Launcher shortcut on your home screen to jot down quick notes, create to-do lists, and easily access important information. <br><br>Please write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.<br><br>You give your consent to install Notes Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app&#39;s Terms and Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy.<br><br>Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.<br><br>Explore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://notepadhome.app/#faq <br>For questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://notepadhome.app/contact-us<br><br>Terms of Service - https://notepadhome.app/terms-of-service    <br>Privacy Policy - https://notepadhome.app/privacy-policy",
